{"4068100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MORRA 3D", "steam_appid": 4068100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCEND INTO THE ODD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MORRA 3D is a fast-paced first-person shooter set in a strange, unsettling world, where grotesque creatures roam among the ruins of colossal, brutalist temples. Survival depends on reflexes, skill, and the storm within.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every strike against your enemies charges a storm inside you. When unleashed, it teleports you through a foe, obliterating them in a burst of electric fury. Navigate fractured landscapes with jagged walls and open skies, armed with four weapons and the storm at your command.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN THIS WORLD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the storm to teleframe enemies in electrified destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive, ruined temples encourage fast, vertical movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four weapons to master for different styles of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chunky, satisfying gibs make every encounter visceral.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsettling architecture and landscapes where angles clash and shadows move. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unleash the storm within.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCEND INTO THE ODD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MORRA 3D is a fast-paced first-person shooter set in a strange, unsettling world, where grotesque creatures roam among the ruins of colossal, brutalist temples. Survival depends on reflexes, skill, and the storm within.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every strike against your enemies charges a storm inside you. When unleashed, it teleports you throu